  "stem_md": "构造数列 $x_n = 2C_n - D_n$，$y_n = D_n - C_n$，$n \\in \\mathbf{N}_+$。则 $x_{n+1} - x_n = 2(C_{n+1} - C_n) - (D_{n+1} - D_n)$\n$= 2(a_{n+1} - b_{n+1})^2 - (a_{n+1} - b_{n+1})^2 - n(b_{n+1}^2 - b_n^2)$\n$+ 2(b_{n+1} - b_n)(a_1 + a_2 + \\cdots + a_n)$\n$= (a_{n+1} - b_{n+1})^2 - n(b_{n+1}^2 - b_n^2) + 2nb_n(b_{n+1} - b_n)$\n$= [(n + 1)b_{n+1} - nb_n - b_{n+1}]^2 - n(b_{n+1}^2 - b_n^2) + 2n(b_{n+1} - b_n)$\n$= (n^2 - n)(b_{n+1} - b_n)^2 \\geqslant 0$，又 $y_1 = D_1 - C_1 = 0$，故对一切 $n \\in \\mathbf{N}_+$，$y_n \\geqslant 0$。\n综上所述，$C_n \\leqslant D_n \\leqslant 2C_n$。",
